<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — resource ThingDefs. Two sub-passes:

  Pass 1 (Iriaz/Mudhorn, 2026-09-12): Mudhorn needs its two eggs
  (CompProperties_EggLayer), its specific meat, its coarse wool
  (CompProperties_Shearable), and its butcher-body-part skull trophy. Iriaz
  needed no new resource — it repoints to the already-ported
  RSW_Reptomammal_Meat (RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml).

  Pass 2 (Anooba/Beldon/Bolotaur, same day): Anooba needs a new leather
  (RSW_Leather_ReptoFur, texPath swresource/Leather_Fur — same folder Wave
  A's RSW_Leather_Bantha already extracted, reused unchanged, no new art).
  Beldon needs a new meat (RSW_Silica_Meat, texPath swresource/Meat_Silica,
  newly extracted this pass) and two new eggs (RSW_EggBeldonFertilized/
  UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggSpore, newly extracted this pass).
  Bolotaur needs two new eggs (RSW_EggBolotaurFertilized/UnFertilized,
  texPath swresource/EggSaurian — already extracted, Wave B, reused
  unchanged); its leather/meat repoint to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Saurian/RSW_Saurian_Meat (RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml).

  Pass 3 (Boma/Borcatu/CanCell, same day): Boma needs no new leather/meat —
  repoints to the already-ported RSW_Leather_Saurian/RSW_Saurian_Meat (Wave
  B) — only its 2 eggs are newly ported (RSW_EggBomaFertilized/
  UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggDapple, newly extracted this pass).
  Borcatu needs a new leather (RSW_Leather_Tough, texPath
  swresource/Leather_Tough, newly extracted) — its specificMeatDef repoints
  to the already-ported RSW_Tough_Meat (Wave B, same donor Tough_Meat used
  by Anooba's meat). CanCell needs a new leather and a new meat
  (RSW_Leather_Insectile / RSW_Insectile_Meat, texPaths
  swresource/Leather_Insectile / swresource/Meat_Insectile, both newly
  extracted) plus its 2 eggs (RSW_EggCanCellFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath
  swresource/EggInsectile, newly extracted).

  Pass 4 (Cannok/Clodhopper/Convor, same day): Cannok needs no new
  resource — repoints leatherDef/specificMeatDef to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Insectile/RSW_Insectile_Meat (Pass 3, same resources
  CanCell uses) and has no egg comp. Clodhopper's leatherDef stays vanilla
  Core `Leather_Bird` (not a Mlie resource, no port needed); its
  specificMeatDef repoints to the already-ported RSW_Reptavian_Meat (Wave
  B); only its 2 eggs are newly ported (RSW_EggClodhopperFertilized/
  UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggSpeckled, newly extracted this
  pass). Convor's leatherDef/specificMeatDef repoint to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Mammavian/RSW_Mammavian_Meat (Wave B); only its 2 eggs are
  newly ported (RSW_EggConvorFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath
  swresource/EggSwirl, newly extracted this pass).

  Pass 5 (Corinathoth/Dactillion/Dalgo, same day): Corinathoth needs no new
  resource — repoints leatherDef/specificMeatDef to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Tough (Pass 3) and RSW_Pachydermoid_Meat (Pass 1). Dalgo needs
  no new resource — repoints to the already-ported RSW_Leather_Saurian/
  RSW_Saurian_Meat (Wave B). Dactillion needs no new leather/meat — repoints
  to the already-ported RSW_Leather_Reptavian/RSW_Reptavian_Meat (Wave B) —
  only its 2 eggs are newly ported (RSW_EggDactillionFertilized/
  UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggWiggly, newly extracted this pass).

  Ported verbatim from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's (workshop folder
  3497316713) ThingDefs_Items/Items_Resource_swanimal_Items.xml, each defName
  flat-RSW_-prefixed. texPaths are UNCHANGED text.
-->
